-*   **Step Size $\Delta t$:** Determined by the resolution level. Higher levels (coarser data) use larger $\Delta t$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Number of Levels $k$:** In experiments, $k=4$ (5 levels) was used for CT data [S1, unofficial].
